{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114219","id":3118852802,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc655erC","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114219","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114219.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114219.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114219","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114219/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114219/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114219/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4cae98216a2b5b500e9103b4f8693a9e62625207","number":114219,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `GD.PushError(Exception)` and `GD.PushWarning(Exception)`","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This pull request makes it possible to push errors to the debugger with an exception that was thrown elsewhere. This would be useful for libraries like GDTask which run user code.\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n\r\nThis is a simple runner that queues actions to run on the next frame:\r\n\r\n```cs\r\npublic partial class MyExampleRunner : Node {\r\n    private readonly Queue<Action> ActionsQueued = [];\r\n\r\n    public override void _Process(double delta) {\r\n        while (ActionsQueued.TryDequeue(out Action? action)) {\r\n            try {\r\n                action();\r\n            }\r\n            catch (Exception ex) {\r\n                GD.PushError(ex); // Debugger takes you here\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    public void QueueAction(Action action) {\r\n        ActionsQueued.Enqueue(action);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is an example that uses `MyExampleRunner`:\r\n\r\n```cs\r\npublic partial class MyExampleRun : Node {\r\n    public override void _Ready() {\r\n        Callable.From(() => {\r\n            MyExampleRunner myExampleRunner = GetParent().GetNode<MyExampleRunner>(\"MyExampleRunner\");\r\n\r\n            myExampleRunner.QueueAction(() => GD.Print(1));\r\n            myExampleRunner.QueueAction(() => GD.Print(2));\r\n            myExampleRunner.QueueAction(() => throw new Exception(\"test message\")); // Debugger should take you here\r\n            myExampleRunner.QueueAction(() => GD.Print(3));\r\n        }).CallDeferred();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn the `throw new Exception(\"test message\")` line, the ideal behaviour would be for the debugger to take you to the line that throws the exception (commented `Debugger should take you here`). But actually, the debugger takes you to the line that pushes the error (commented `Debugger takes you here`).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-12-19T21:16:25Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:09:55Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"db56e2f5005cb34ea9ecf7e20eadb2272c61956c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"l